+- `lenses.spec.ts` - the output lenses on an agent message. The lens API is
+  mocked, so no model or network access is needed: the menu offers the five
+  lenses, an ELI5 answer shows up inline under the message with its cost, the
+  result is collapsible, picking the same lens twice is served from the cache
+  without a second call, and the architecture lens renders its mermaid block as
+  an SVG diagram instead of showing the source.
 
